<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Soumik Halder · Design Engineer · soumik.design</title>
<meta name="description" content="Soumik Halder is a design engineer who designs and builds interfaces end to end: brand, motion, WebGL, and the code that ships it. Maker of WhyClub.">
